DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T210000
SUMMARY: Beginner Square Dance Party – No Partner Needed!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n\\#\\# 🎉 Square
  Dance Party Night – Beginners Welcome\\!\n\n**Never square danced befor
 e? This party is for you!**\n\nJoin **[Capital Squares](https://capitalsqu
 ares.org)** for a fun\, relaxed square dance party designed especially for
  **first-timers and curious beginners**.\n\n**Note: Space is limited to 40
  new dancers!** Grab your tickets on [Eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/1984382456345?aff=oddtdtcreator)before they sell out. **This event is
  cross-posted and open to the public.**\n\n📅 Tuesday\, May 12\, 2026\n
 📍 St. James United Methodist Church\, 3808 St. James Church Rd\, Raleig
 h\, NC\n⏰ 7:00 to 9:00 pm. Doors open at 6:30.\n**Cost: $10.00 per perso
 n** via [eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1984382456345?aff=oddtdt
 creator). Zelle\, cash or check at the door.\n\n\\#\\#\\# What This Is\nA 
 lively\, social square dance party where **everyone is welcome** — even 
 if you’ve never danced before.\nWe’ll start with **easy\, walk-through
  instruction**\, then dance the night away with friendly guidance and lots
  of laughter.\n\n\\#\\#\\# What You Need to Know\n\n* **No experience requ
 ired**\n* **No partner needed**\n* Casual attire — wear comfortable clot
 hes and shoes\n* Friendly atmosphere — we rotate partners and dance toge
 ther\n* Great music\, great people\, and lots of fun\n\n\\#\\#\\# Who Shou
 ld Come\n\n* Adults who have never square danced\n* Couples\, singles\, an
 d friends\n* Children 10 or older accompanied by a participating adult.\n*
  Anyone looking for a fun\, social night out in Raleigh\n* People curious 
 about trying something new in 2026\n\n\\#\\#\\# Why Try Square Dancing?\nS
 quare dancing is easy to start\, mentally engaging\, and one of the **best
  ways to meet people** while having fun. You’ll be dancing successfully 
 your very first night.\n\n👉 Purchase your ticket on Eventbrite ([https:
 //www.eventbrite.com/e/1851126752949](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1984382
 456345?aff=oddtdtcreator)) and join us for a night of fun\, laughter\, and
  community with **Capital Squares**!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 4268340/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260413T193600Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T193600Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
